

>> Cat := Ima musuq.

Cat patapi: ['musuq'] ruway: {
	ñuqap sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat patapi: ['nieuw'] ruway: {
	ñuqap sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat patapi: ['makeSound'] ruway: { <- ñuqap sound.
}.

Cat patapi: ['greet'] ruway: { <- kikin makeSound.
}.

>> cat := Cat musuq.
Lluqsiy qillqay: cat greet.
